KG42.register("slice-clusters-439b810a2b700b8091a7bfcb",{"id":"01-central_pool::v142-d-K001","paper":"01-central_pool","title":"Welfare clearing and internal energy pricing in a shared-bus community","source_pointer":"/clusters/0","node_ids":["COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","COMP-aa22fdcebf0da947","COMP-ebacec241379c91d","COMP-3e92318d3f30d9b2","KG31-894086c352040b17","KG40-f19328f0aeb3d626"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R001","01-central_pool::v141-c-R002","01-central_pool::v141-c-R004","01-central_pool::v141-c-R005","01-central_pool::v141-c-R006"],"visible_rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R001","01-central_pool::v141-c-R002","01-central_pool::v141-c-R004","01-central_pool::v141-c-R005","01-central_pool::v141-c-R006"],"suppressed_rule_refs":[],"edges":[{"global_edge_id":"S-f287b3f2a40a4640","source":"COMP-aa22fdcebf0da947","target":"COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R001::E::v141-c-R001-E001"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R001"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-c8227485b5d32d59","source":"COMP-aa22fdcebf0da947","target":"COMP-ebacec241379c91d","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R002::E::v141-c-R002-E001"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R002"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-8a98dcd2c262660f","source":"COMP-3e92318d3f30d9b2","target":"COMP-ebacec241379c91d","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R002::E::v141-c-R002-E002"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R002"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-04c692b1adad7677","source":"COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","target":"COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R004::E::v141-c-R004-E001"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R004"],"internal":true},{"global_edge_id":"S-5a14ace5133091cb","source":"KG31-894086c352040b17","target":"COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R004::E::v141-c-R004-E002"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R004"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-ba5c4a1e8d46ba50","source":"COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","target":"KG31-894086c352040b17","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005::E::v141-c-R005-E001"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-ceeab6187d2d8a37","source":"COMP-ebacec241379c91d","target":"KG31-894086c352040b17","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005::E::v141-c-R005-E002"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-cacb6ffd8783724b","source":"KG31-894086c352040b17","target":"COMP-f0015e75a5829a38","type":"conditional_on","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005::E::v141-c-R005-E003"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-823d70a828a0ba22","source":"COMP-3e92318d3f30d9b2","target":"KG31-894086c352040b17","type":"links","assertion_ids":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005::E::v141-c-R005-E004"],"rule_refs":["01-central_pool::v141-c-R005"],"internal":false}],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"interface_annotations":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e005","v141-b-g01-e020","v141-b-g01-e022"],"rationale":"The flow boundary of the internal product on the shared bus connects to entity and community energy balances; the composite constraints of R001 also include entity balances and cannot, as a whole, be treated as a copy of the product balance."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C005","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C006","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C007"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e011","v141-b-g01-e017","v141-b-g02-E04","v141-b-g02-E12","v141-b-g02-E14"],"rationale":"The same lower-level problem chooses among the allocations defined by R001, with R002 evaluating net energy benefits, reserve revenue, and peak costs; this assembly does not resolve transcription discrepancies in the objective coefficients."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::var_e_u_t_com","v141-c-R001::x::var_i_u_t_com"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-e-com","v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-i-com","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e011","v141-b-g01-e015","v141-b-g02-E35"],"rationale":"The source directly lists community exchange quantities as transaction quantities determined at the lower level, supporting the interface from planned allocations to their interpretation as transactions without introducing actual-delivery or metering obligations."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L04","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C006"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e003","v141-b-g01-e011","v141-b-g01-e025"],"rationale":"Welfare maximization and marginal pricing belong to the same lower-level market design; the price interpretation comes from the dual quantities of the specified balance constraints, and a complete dual system cannot be inferred solely from the name of the objective."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L05","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C006","v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-mu"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e020","v141-b-g01-e022","v141-b-g01-e025","v141-b-g03-e23"],"rationale":"Entity and community balances correspond to entity prices and the community-balance dual quantity, respectively; the two types of dual quantities remain distinct and are linked through the given price conditions."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L06","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::x::v141-c-R005-x-pi_com","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::x::v141-c-R004-pi-com","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e025","v141-b-g02-E16","v141-b-g03-e29"],"rationale":"The clearing price for the same entity and time period is used to value internal transactions. The price conditions hold with equality only when the transaction quantity in the corresponding direction is strictly positive; the accounting sign of the valuation term is listed separately as a gap."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L07","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C008"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g03-e30","v141-b-g04-E14"],"rationale":"The two occurrences express the same conditional mutual-exclusivity property of community imports and exports; R004 states the conditions in prose, so its bare expression cannot be interpreted as an unconditional constraint."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L08","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e005","v141-b-g01-e022","v141-b-g02-E08"],"rationale":"Within the shared-bus scope of this cluster, both occurrences represent the community's hourly internal energy balance and constitute product and transaction perspectives on the same constraint."}],"annotation_policy":"Original D connections are annotations, not additional S edges.","empty_after_chain_suppression":false});
